	(text "INTER-BOX CABLE (BUILD_GUIDE 4.8.3). MCU side on the left, the DB-25 on the right.\nOutputs: 1 k in series (330 R on CAN_TX), so a pod on USB cannot push more than ~3 mA into an\nunpowered power box. Inputs: a 10 k pull-up on the cable side gives the SAFE reading with the\ncable out (kill engaged, box absent, brake light off, CAN recessive); 1 k + 10 nF filter PWM noise.\nBRAKE_CURRENT: 1 k + 100 nF (1.6 kHz) removes the 20 kHz ripple; 100 k reads 0 V with the cable out."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4313a249-fbdd-4db5-b692-62105fe7486b")
	)
